sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as React UI
  participant Store as Zustand Store
  participant Engine as TM Engine
  participant Tape as Sparse Tape
  User->>UI: Enter 1101 and initialize
  UI->>Store: initialize()
  Store->>Engine: initializeMachine(1101)
  Engine->>Tape: create sparse cells
  loop each requested step
    User->>UI: Step or Run
    UI->>Store: step()
    Store->>Engine: executeStep()
    Engine->>Tape: read write move
    Engine-->>Store: configuration and snapshot
    Store-->>UI: render tape graph history
  end
  UI-->>User: ACCEPTED after 5 transitions
